## Dependency Rules

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    Transport --> Application
    Application --> Domain
    Application --> RepositoryInterfaces[Repository Interfaces]
    RepositoryImplementations[Repository Implementations] --> RepositoryInterfaces
    RepositoryImplementations --> Database
    Infrastructure --> Application
    Infrastructure --> RepositoryImplementations
    Domain --> Shared[Shared Types and Utilities]
```

Rules include:

- Transport depends on Application Services.
- Application Services depend on Domain Services and repository interfaces.
- Domain Services must not depend on transport frameworks.
- Domain Services must not depend directly on Supabase or Vercel.
- Repository implementations may depend on database infrastructure.
- Infrastructure details must not leak into domain logic.
- Circular dependencies are prohibited.
- Server-only modules must not be imported into client components.
- Shared utilities must remain focused and must not become a miscellaneous dumping ground.

